(Regression: a `value` variable reports its runtime tag as a dynamic type.)

a value called vtxt is "hello".
a value called vnum is 42.
a value called vflt is 3.5.
a value called vbool is true.
a value called vnil is nothing.

Print "{vtxt's type}".
Print "{vnum's type}".
Print "{vflt's type}".
Print "{vbool's type}".
Print "{vnil's type}".
